<pvxbig>This build enhances its healing capabilities with [[Shadow Theft@14], while also having access to a powerful [[Splinter Weapon@15].</pvxbig>
== Attributes and Skills ==
<pvxbig>
[build prof=Assassin/Ritualist CriticalStrikes=10+1+3 RestorationMagic=11 ChannelingMagic=10][Shadow Theft][Ebon Escape][Mend Body and Soul@16][Spirit Light@16][Protective Was Kaolai@16][Life@11<!-- NOTE: Rank 11 since it's used before Shadow Theft -->][Splinter Weapon@15][Spirit Siphon@15][/build]
'''Variants'''

Replace Splinter Weapon with {{skill pvxicon|Spirit Transfer|17}} if you lack martial party members, or if more healing is desired. Lower Channeling Magic to 8, raise Restoration Magic to 12.

Consider replacing other skills in the following situations:
* Protective Was Kaolai – for party size 4 and 6.
* Life – in a team with other spirits.
* Spirit Siphon – with a [[Blood is Power] user.

Variant skills:
* {{skill pvxicon|Spirit Transfer|16}}
* {{skill pvxicon|Ancestors' Rage|15}}
* {{skill pvxicon|Great Dwarf Armor}} - In PUGs without another source of bonus armor.
* {{skill pvxicon|Great Dwarf Weapon}} - Supplement Splinter Weapon, with multiple martial party members.
* {{skill pvxicon|"You Are All Weaklings!"}} - Use with a [[gww:Heavy|heavy]] weapon in your shield set.
</pvxbig>

== Equipment ==
'''Armor'''
* 5 [[gww:Survivor Insignia|survivor insignias]].
* Rune of [[gww:Rune of Vigor|superior vigor]].
* 3 runes of [[gww:Rune of Vitae|vitae]].

'''Weapons'''
* [[gww:40/40|40/40]] restoration magic.
* 40/40 channeling magic if using Splinter Weapon.
* [[gww:Caster_weapon#High_energy_set|High energy set]] restoration magic.
* Shield set: [[gww:Inscription#Spell enhancing|"Don't Think Twice"]] martial weapon [[gww:of defense|of defense]] with a shield [[gww:Of Fortitude|of fortitude]].

== Usage ==
<pvxbig>
'''Weapon set usage'''
* Cast spells in the appropriate 40/40 set. [[Spirit Siphon@15] can be used in any weapon set.
* Switch to your high energy set when needed.
* Switch to your shield set when idle, under attack, or using [[Shadow Theft@14].

'''Skill usage'''
* Engage with [[Life@11] → Shadow Theft → [[Ebon Escape] back to safety.
** Prefer a target heavily impaired by the attribute loss.
** Ideally, let a tanking party member or [[gww:EVAS|EVAS]] take aggro first.
* Spot heal and remove potent conditions with [[Spirit Light@16], [[Mend Body and Soul@16] and Ebon Escape.
* Maintain [[Splinter Weapon@15] on martial party members.
* Use Life on recharge.
* Drain spirits high on energy with Spirit Siphon.
* Party heal with [[Protective Was Kaolai@16]. Cast it preemptively when your other skills aren't needed and energy is plentiful.
* Renew Shadow Theft as needed.
** If possible, use it as the fight ends. This improves Splinter Weapon buffing outside of combat.
</pvxbig>
== Counters ==
<pvxbig>
* Standard anti-caster.
** As a martial profession, you will not be targeted with [[Backfire] when in shield set or holding Protective Was Kaolai.
* Spirit being killed with none other in earshot.
</pvxbig>
== Notes ==
* Using Shadow Theft or Ebon Escape forces you to drop Protective Was Kaolai.

